  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Quality Improvement Programme &#x2013; Tanzania (EQUIP-T)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the improvement of the quality of education in primary schools in Tanzania and to increase the number of children, particularly girls, able to transfer to secondary education by improved teaching of early grade reading and numeracy.</narrative>
  </description>
